      <description>Graham’s The Family Dairy enjoyed a successful Royal Highland Show, picking up a range of product and cattle awards. The new addition to their butter range, Scottish Butter with Isle of Skye Sea Salt was crowned Champion Butter and their Slightly Salted Butter was awarded Reserve Champion Butter.</description>
